"scenario.competitor_brief.prompt_1.body" = "Compare <Product A> and <Product B> and output: 1) feature comparison table; 2) pricing strategy; 3) target users; 4) strengths and weaknesses; 5) executable opportunities for our team. Add a source link to each key conclusion.";
